Printers: there are plenty of high quality printer manufacturers who are
profitable. And remember that DEC didn't just make LASER ones.

Where HP (and previous to that EPSON and previous to that CENTRONICS)
have succeeded in it marketing and sales. 

>     Ask the folks at Micropolis how many profitable hard drive
> manufacturers there are now. (Answer: two --- Seagate and Quantum, with
