DEC never completed that plan to go to that market ? 

Had Digital gone "build to order"  route, it would not have had to worry
about overstocking VARs and resellers.  

Palmer promised serious re-engineering of Digital. Why didn't Palmer
take a serious look at Compaq or Dell and try to copy them for the PC
business ?



