  Very few (none?) of the folks from DEC -- among those DEC folks that
  regularly post to the newsgroups -- can do so without also including
  a basic disclaimer.  My postings here do not necessarily reflect the
  position of the corporation -- I am not an officer of the corporation,
  nor can I represent the corporation here.  Nor can most of the other
  DEC folks that post here generally represent the corporation.

:  Unfortunately, as many punters pointed out, 
