all will be needed is a small takeover bid by Compaq or perhaps even
Apple.

I have a feeling that the huge cash reserves may go towards the
remaining shareholders. Once done, then the actual value of Digital will
be low enough for anyone to buy what is left. 

DIGITAL: IT IS HIGH TIME THAT YOU COME OUT IN THE OPEN AND STOP ALL THE
SPECULATION ABOUT YOUR FUTURE BEFORE IT BECOMES A SELF FULLING PROPHECY.

DIGITAL: Your seemingly constant shedding of divisions only adds to the
		  speculation. you really need to counter this if you want to 
		  survive. A lack of public statement on your future is 
		  tantamount to admitting defeat and that you are indeed having
		  a fire sale.



