The command to transfer from one disk to tape is,

backup/image/verify dua0: mua0:

from tape to disk

backup/image/verify mua0: dua0:

Use Standalone Backup, you can't go wrong.

Backup will initialize the output volume for the correct cluster size and
file structure and also this process will of course result in a
defragmented disk.

