You'll need more than just a soldering iron.  The CRT's emission has
dropped.

"Rejuvenation" is possible, but far from a "permanent" fix.  To
quote from the sci.electronics FAQ (http://www.paranoia.com/~filipg/):

16.9) CRT rejuvenation

   Where one or more electron guns in the CRT have deteriorated due to
   wear and tear, it is sometimes possible to give them a new, but
