of the matter is that when MS plays dirty, it has far greater consequences
than if one of the little guys were to do the same.  Any company that
achieves a near-monopoly in so many markets, that continues to resort
to such Machiavellian (and questionably legal) tactics to chop up 
even potential competitors, deserves to be placed under some scrutiny.

