I think that no compiler would ever generate this code, unless you
deliberately put it into your program for obvious purposes. 

However, with  auto-downloaded-and-executed code (like in ActiveX)
you are vulnerable to any kinds of attacks, be it trojan horses, 
virus dropping, password spoofing, or machine crashing. 
