corresponding propaganda for a new tool. If anyone likes to use e.g.
ms powerpoint to produce some sheets, fine, but try to convert the result
into a PostScript file, too. It works. All one needs to do is to create
a printer queue on the PC box with a new PostScript printer as target
(some old ms printer drivers produce garbage) and let the documents be
printed into files instead of to the printer interface. Thanks!

