Steve Garrett (remove .spm for proper email address) wrote:
> 
> For those soles that were not able to attend DECUS, is there anything
> that stands out in peoples heads that they saw?
> 
> How did DEC ^h^h^h Digital respond to all of the press that the ALPHA
> is dead?
> 
