I'd suggest that you go with the Intel machine, BUT (since you were
ready to plunk down 1K for the Alpha) I'd bump the P166 up to 32 or
even 64 MB of RAM.  You WILL notice the difference.  Also, if you plan
on running X I'd get a good video card.  I'd suggest Redhat linux for
the linux distribution.  Also, make sure that NONE of your components
are plug and play (or at least that they can be hardware configured).
