>(which is a free operating system designed to run on inexpensive,
>single processor machines) runs in 64 bit mode on Alpha instead of 32
>bit mode (like VMS does)?  If your arguments are true, it would be
>cheaper, faster and satisfy more of its potential users.  If your
>arguments are so convincing, wouldn't someone have 'ported' it back to
