One thing about Alpha NT benchmarks:

  BEWARE!!!

  If you compile c or C++ code by default you get EMULATED floating point. Only
recently did the distribution get the DPML library (digital portable math lib)
which can be linked in to get hardware floating point. If you don't use this,
expect Alpha floating performance not too impressive wrt intel. I don't
know if it is the default even now.


