The new software is available from Digital.
You need to either have a software contract or an earlier version of 2.* to get
the current version.

The update basically goes like this.
upgrade the wweng2 file on your load server.
log into the ds900 and issue a command similar to the following

INIT FROM ETHER IMAGE imagename UPDATE
    FLASH DELAY 0 where "imagename" is WWENG2 for the DS700 and DS900 or
    MNENG2 for the DS90M.

the server requests a load over the ethernet from a load host and then loads the
image into the firmware module and saves it.

Brian V



